 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kirei na Kimi ni Korosaretai."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "綺麗な君に殺されたい。"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Want To Be Killed By Your Beautiful Self."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Tomoaki Hijiri, a university counselor, lives a peacefully ordinary yet unsatisfying life. That changes when he reunites with Hajime Amawashi, a strikingly beautiful young man from his past, after more than a decade. His striking beauty is made all the more captivating by his air of mystery…\n\nTempted by those words, Tomoaki becomes entangled in the strange and unsettling cases his patients bring to him. What is the true nature of the bizarre phenomena unfolding around him? And what is the real reason Hajime has for suddenly appearing by his side…?",
   "ja": "大学でカウンセラーを勤める聖智明は、平穏ながらも満たされない日々を送っていた。\nしかし、かつての知り合い天鷲一との再会を境に、その生活は一変。\n患者たちの持ち込む不可解な相談が、次第に日常を侵し始める。\n彼らが巻き込まれていく怪現象の正体、そして、智明の元に突然現れた一の本当の目的とは───。\n\n気鋭のホラー小説家・芦花公園×実力派の新星・芳野嗣が放つ倒錯的ホラーノワール、開幕。"
  },
